# Title: UAC Bypass Using NTFS Reparse Point - Process
# ID: 39ed3c80-e6a1-431b-9df3-911ac53d08a7
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Christian Burkard (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-08-30
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
# Description: Detects the pattern of UAC Bypass using NTFS reparse point and wusa.exe DLL hijacking (UACMe 36)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_exec="\"C:\\Windows\\system32\\wusa.exe\"  /quiet C:\\Users\\*" AND process_exec="*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\update.msu" AND (IntegrityLevel="High" OR IntegrityLevel="System" OR IntegrityLevel="S-1-16-16384" OR IntegrityLevel="S-1-16-12288")) OR (parent_process_exec="\"C:\\Windows\\system32\\dism.exe\" /online /quiet /norestart /add-package /packagepath:\"C:\\Windows\\system32\\pe386\" /ignorecheck" AND (IntegrityLevel="High" OR IntegrityLevel="System") AND (process_exec="*C:\\Users\\*" AND process_exec="*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*" AND process_exec="*\\dismhost.exe {*") AND process_path="*\\DismHost.exe"))
